      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Type a **payout_id** (e.g. `M-0042:1187`), an **event_id** (same format: `<merchant>:<seq>`) or a **channel** (merchant, e.g. `M-0042`) above. Oldest line first. Per-payout lines come from the **executor** (claim \u2192 send \u2192 bank response \u2192 paid); the consumer logs per batch, so for the consumer-side context of a payout use its **event_id** (same value as the payout_id) or its **channel**."
